{
  "_comment": [
    "Orbital PerAct2 (bimanual) camera-group assignment.",
    "Deterministic rotation over G1-G6 keyed on the task's index in",
    "PERACT2_TASKS (datasets/rlbench.py), which is also its task_id:",
    "task i trains on [G(i%6+1), G((i+1)%6+1), G((i+2)%6+1)] and is",
    "evaluated on the next group in the rotation, G((i+3)%6+1).",
    "train_groups: the 3 (task, group) shards that build train.zarr/val.zarr,",
    "30 collected episodes each -> 90 train episodes per task.",
    "eval_group: held-out 'new cam' for online VLA rollouts (10 per task).",
    "Camera poses for every group live in instructions/orbital_cameras_grouped.json.",
    "The 3 groups per task that appear in neither field stay on disk as",
    "unused shards for later ablations."
  ],
